cards.content:
### Membaca contoh

```html
<label>Email <input type="email" required></label>
<button type="button">Daftar</button>
<button type="button" disabled>Ditutup</button>
<ul><li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li></ul>
```

```css
input[type="email"] { border: 2px solid navy; }
button:hover { background-color: gold; }
input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid orange; }
button:disabled { opacity: 0.5; }
li:nth-child(2) { font-weight: bold; }
```

Border membatasi kolom email. Tombol nonaktif lebih transparan. Outline menandai fokus tanpa mengambil ruang layout. Item kedua ditebalkan berdasarkan posisinya.

